/P 254 0 R
/E (Be sure to request an itemized bill from your provider and submit your Sharing Request, along with any required documentation, as soon as possible. Related medical expenses must accumulate to your MRA within six months of the initial date of service to establish eligibility. Once your MRA has been met, the Sharing Request will remain open for the duration of the medical event, provided there is no six-month consecutive gap in related treatment or expenses. If a six-month gap in consecutive treatment occurs, the Sharing Request will automatically close, and any subsequent treatment will require a new Sharing Request and a new MRA.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
